                  <span class="shrink-0 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] font-mono font-bold text-amber-700 mt-1 w-8">Q{i + 1}</span>
                  <div class="flex-1">
                    <p class="font-display text-sm leading-snug text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-2">{qi.q}</p>
                    <p class="text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]">
                      <span class="font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-amber-700 mr-1">Why</span>
                      {qi.why}
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-[13px] text-[var(--color-ink-faint)] italic leading-relaxed">
      Default at end of meeting: anything unanswered drops to Marco's working list as an open assumption, marked in the leomares-co working file. Re-surfaces at Day 30 joint review.
    </p>
  </Section>

